      "value": "Wanted to give an example Pic(quick edit), of kinda what i was going for(not the same example given above, but one that would have more particles on them, or weapons..ect).\nFor this, we can see the base model is indeed optimized.\nbut, for animations side, we can see they're using particles in this case that made it that high.\nHope this helps on what i am getting at.\n~Todd",
