      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5dcae10f2fb049260da562f6|full_name}: Yea, that is the whole idea of this system too.\nWe would know what is animations and what is not(original would only tell you the true stats of what is visibly shown, and the animations/hidden would show the stats of animations and objects turned off).\nThis way we know who is not bothering with optimizing and would know who is lagging the instance you're in..\nThe current system just tell us, they're very poor... but why...\nIs it because of hidden items or just truly poor(not caring).\nSo yea, we need this system. :)\ni have a picture as an example below.\n~Todd",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
