      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "kinda wish for something like this, but instead assign a value per game object on the player, and this value would accumulate to how optimized the player is. As such, when an animation enables/disables objects, reassign their current value so you could have something like the particle limiter, but for the whole avatar.",
